---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base description="Hi, I post whatever sparks my interest.">
  <main>
    <div class="intro">
      <h1 class="lead">Hi, I post whatever sparks my interest.</h1>
      <p>
        Expect a mix of open media and articles where I share my (very) opinionated views, I
        definitely have a habit of overtalking. I’m not here to grind out daily content, I only
        post when I have a good reason to.
      </p>
      <p>
        Visually, I’m a bit of a perfectionist. I love highly curated, intentionally arranged
        posts, but my ultimate aesthetic is simplicity. I like to keep things clean and never
        over-do it.
      </p>
      <p>Feel free to be.</p>
      <a
        class="youtube"
        href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHg7B8Odtgbp72C6gqGRM9xEvxLASr9OX"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> Fav-Dump
        <span class="sr-only"> (YouTube playlist, opens in a new tab)</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="frame">
      <img src="/images/drawing.jpg" width="857" height="406" alt="" />
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    padding-top: 32px;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .youtube {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 10px 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 6px;
  }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: -1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  .frame {
    margin-top: 28px;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    line-height: 0;
  }

  .frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    main {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: start;
      padding-top: 56px;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 46ch;
    }

    p {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .lead {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .youtube {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .frame {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
